# Copy to .env for local development. .env is gitignored; .env.example is not.
#
# Web3Forms access key for the contact form, issued to info@psml.ke at
# https://web3forms.com. Vite substitutes it into contact.html at build time via
# the %VITE_WEB3FORMS_KEY% token.
#
# Set the same variable in Cloudflare Pages:
#   Workers & Pages -> your project -> Settings -> Environment variables
#   Add VITE_WEB3FORMS_KEY for BOTH Production and Preview, then redeploy.
#   Pages only applies environment variables to builds started after they are
#   added, so an existing deployment will not pick it up - trigger a new one.
#
# This value is NOT a secret: it ends up in the built page and only authorises
# submissions to this one form. It lives here to stay out of git and to be
# rotatable without a commit, not to be hidden from visitors.
VITE_WEB3FORMS_KEY=
